      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Except Jehovah build the house,\nThey labor in vain that build it:\nExcept Jehovah keep the city,\nThe watchman waketh but in vain.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.127.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.127.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "It is vain for you to rise up early,\nTo take rest late,\nTo eat the bread of toil;",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "For",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " so he giveth unto his beloved sleep.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.127.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.127.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Lo, children are a heritage of Jehovah;",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "And",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the fruit of the womb is ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "his",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " reward.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.127.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.127.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "As arrows in the hand of a mighty man,\nSo are the children of youth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.127.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.127.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Happy is the man that hath his quiver full of them:\nThey shall not be put to shame,\nWhen they speak with their enemies in the gate.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    }
  ],
